<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your DigiAd AI Subscription Has Expired</title>
</head>

<body
    style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #000000; margin: 0; padding: 0; min-height: 100vh;">
    <div class="email-container"
        style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);">

        <div class="header"
            style="background-color: #6b7280; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b7280, #4b5563); color: #ffffff; text-align: center; padding: 30px 20px;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">Your Subscription Has Expired</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content" style="padding: 30px 20px; color: #333333;">
            <p style="margin: 16px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">Hi <strong
                    style="color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;">{{FirstName}}</strong>,</p>
            <p style="margin: 16px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">Your DigiAd subscription has
                expired</p>

            <div class="comparison-table"
                style="background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #333333; text-align: left;">⏸️ Current Account Status</h3>

                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 4px 0;">
                            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                                style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 6px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; color: #555555;">Credits</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #ef4444;">❌
                                        Inactive</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                   
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 4px 0;">
                            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                                style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 6px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; color: #555555;">AI Ad & Video Generation</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #ef4444;">❌
                                        Inactive</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 4px 0;">
                            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                                style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 6px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; color: #555555;">Advanced Analytics</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #ef4444;">❌
                                        Inactive</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 4px 0;">
                            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                                style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 6px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; color: #555555;">Priority Support</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 12px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #ef4444;">❌
                                        Inactive</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </div>

            <p style="margin: 16px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">Your campaigns have been
                paused, but all your data and campaigns are safely stored.</p>
            <p style="margin: 16px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555;">To continue running campaigns
                and accessing premium features, simply renew your subscription.</p>

            <div class="offer-box"
                style="background-color: #f0f4ff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4ff, #faf5ff); border: 2px solid #667eea; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; text-align: center;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #667eea; font-size: 20px;">🎁 Welcome Back Offer</h3>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #333333;">
                    <strong>Renew within 7 days and get 15% off your next month.</strong>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
                <a href="{{renewLink}}" class="cta-button"
                    style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; font-size: 16px; color: #ffffff !important; background-color: #667eea; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);">Renew
                    My Subscription</a>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #555555; margin-top: 30px; text-align: center;">
                Need help? Contact us anytime at <a href="mailto:support@digiad.ai"
                    style="color: #667eea; text-decoration: none;">support@digiad.ai</a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer"
            style="background-color: #f8f9fa; color: #666666; text-align: center; padding: 25px 20px; font-size: 13px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">
            <p style="margin: 5px 0;">Best,<br>Team DigiAd</p>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0;">© 2026 DigiAd AI. All rights reserved.</p>

            {{#if unsubscribeLink}}
            <p class="unsubscribe" style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 12px; color: #999999;">
                <a href="{{unsubscribeLink}}" style="color: #999999; text-decoration: underline;">Unsubscribe from these
                    emails</a>
            </p>
            {{/if}}
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>